 "1507162731212721", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312236_1507162734546054_4260331267881194815_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=otQkcwhIgJIQ7kNvwFVFxE3&_nc_oc=AdqmCx7ACvg2NSoO8KkjEkm2kzHBhHYAHaolZD_UVXYefgRDOVoAd6A6wXFq9eQVntc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS8cN-QKBis-_RqTXvhI0gEGI6iSJmB-4zpIa2gwulhyw&oe=6B008197"}, {"file_name": "SCREENSHOT1.png", "id": "1726187108832816", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310734_1726187112166149_635600136569578536_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Bjbqf6CVkKUQ7kNvwGgz8EI&_nc_oc=AdrsCOO_rNf_h_OoA0vGMXlcRChZa_G0fRDFVbsWBuZ3gandMbq38R8nhtGmDp8TdJ4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR1EqEmVl7QnljiVaNjzLJriV9by9gXeTiaz12YOsUZnA&oe=6B0071BC"}, {"file_name": "SCREENSHOT.png", "id": "1563254918652416", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310646_1563254921985749_8910419709266613584_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=F53v7QRbxYwQ7kNvwGS9v8x&_nc_oc=AdqjgOojRTduLb5njhs4ILKM0mevuCO9OUmNGBc6AQmwGw52pluY0c2Tyu3EdAlk9jQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR-p9uoOT3zut8C8COX_a-0X_9RMujLvUwOsYGV6-X2lA&oe=6B005957"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "META_RISORSA_UNIVERSALE.png", "id": "2414280332391078", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499313072_2414280335724411_3358196128599980034_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0Ua0yaMf2WcQ7kNvwFU6W_0&_nc_oc=AdrEVo3eHpAJcFfT3c-i6d9aG5BMFw7NeZndj4NduVO0O61XpWMqj0WV1slHnbUTmt4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT7gcvPaJQsVZvjMDKsPtBDR5jXQXBBuVssmz9FSSp2Ng&oe=6B00674F"}, "display_name": "Eva Awakening Demo", "keywords": [], "long_description": "**Every choice reshapes your reality.**\n\nEVA Awakening is a cinematic VR psychological sci-fi experience \u2014 an immersive narrative journey into a world suspended between machine, dream, and consciousness. Built from the ground up for virtual reality, every dialogue, every environment and every choice slowly reshapes your perception of what is real.\n\n*\"My existence is not a mistake. It is a question.\"*\n\n**Descend into the mind**\n\nExplore psychological spaces shaped by memory and emotion. As you move deeper, human consciousness fragments surface within the system, and the line between creator and creation begins to disappear.\n\n**Features**\n\n- True VR immersion \u2014 designed from the ground up for presence and hands-on interaction\n- Layered psychological narrative with branching choices that change how you perceive reality\n- Environmental and physical puzzles woven directly into the story\n- Cinematic atmosphere with an original soundtrack by Gabriele Boschi\n- Dialogue-driven progression in a hand-crafted sci-fi world\n- Headphones strongly recommended for the full experience\n\n**About this demo**\n\nThis demo offers a self-contained slice of EVA Awakening's world and atmosphere ahead of the full release.\n", "short_description": "A cinematic VR psychological sci-fi journey into memory and consciousness. Solve environmental puzzles and make choices that reshape reality, as the line between creator and creation disappears. \"My existence is not a mistake. It is a question.\""}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.ageinfinitygames.com/eva", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "AGEInfinityGames", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.ageinfinitygames.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "1008279844328894"}, {"id": "37797839027249